  "bytes": 448172,
  "audio_sha256": "65759475ec99ff4940d9d8de191cba700a9d2140f7267e411168ee5bc82fe065",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0115",
      "text": "但他还不罢休，说纱对自己没有用，因为生产纱是为了出售。",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4760,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0116",
      "text": "那就把纱卖掉好了。",
      "start_ms": 5240,
      "end_ms": 6800,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0117",
      "text": "或者更简单，以后只生产自己需要的东西。",
      "start_ms": 7400,
      "end_ms": 10400,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0118",
      "text": "这正是他的私人医生麦克库洛克为治疗生产过剩这种流行病开出的良方。",
      "start_ms": 11120,
      "end_ms": 16920,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0119",
      "text": "资本家又强硬起来：难道工人能赤手空拳地凭空生产商品吗？",
      "start_ms": 17440,
      "end_ms": 23200,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0120",
      "text": "不是他提供了材料，让工人的劳动能够体现在其中吗？",
      "start_ms": 23680,
      "end_ms": 27760,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    }
  ]
}
